COMMENT PRESERVATION IN BLOCK LISTS
---
# header
items: # after colon
  # before first
  - first # inline first
  # before second
  - second # inline second
  # before third
  - third # inline third
# footer
---
- [prepend, [items], zero]
- [insert, [items], 2, mid]
- [append, [items], last]
- [update, [items, 1], first_updated]
- [remove, [items, 3]]
